@startuml
!include ../../rixte/shortfall/style.iuml
title Executing list-recipes 2

participant ":MishMash" as App
participant "cmd:ListRecipeCommand" as Cmd
participant "recipeBook:RecipeBook" as Book
participant "viewer:RecipeViewer" as Viewer

ref over App, Cmd : Parse "list-recipes 2"

App -> Cmd : executeWithResult(recipeBook)
activate Cmd

Cmd -> Book : getRecipes()
activate Book
Book --> Cmd : recipes
deactivate Book

create Viewer
Cmd -> Viewer : RecipeViewer()
activate Viewer
deactivate Viewer

Cmd -> Viewer : view(recipe)
activate Viewer
Viewer --> Cmd : details
deactivate Viewer

Cmd --> App : result
deactivate Cmd
Viewer -[hidden]-> App
destroy Viewer
Cmd -[hidden]-> App
destroy Cmd

note over Cmd, Viewer
  recipe is the second element of recipes. result is a CommandResult holding
  the details and an info status. The no-index form returns the numbered list
  instead and creates no viewer.
end note
@enduml
